  <h3 id="result">버튼을 누르고, 초록색이 되면 최대한 빨리 다시 누르세요</h3>
  <script>
    var __timers = [];

    var state, ms;

    function mathRandomInt(a, b) {
      if (a > b) {
        // Swap a and b to ensure a is smaller.
        var c = a;
        a = b;
        b = c;
      }
      return Math.floor(Math.random() * (b - a + 1) + a);
    }

    __timers.push(setInterval(function () {
      ms = (typeof ms === 'number' ? ms : 0) + 20;
    }, 20));
    document.getElementById("tapBtn").addEventListener('click', function () {
      if (state == 2) {
        state = 0;
        document.getElementById("result").textContent = String(ms) + 'ms';
        document.getElementById("tapBtn").textContent = '다시 하기';
        document.getElementById("tapBtn").style.background = "#ffc93c";
      } else if (state == 0) {
        state = 1;
        document.getElementById("result").textContent = '';
        document.getElementById("tapBtn").textContent = '기다려...';
        document.getElementById("tapBtn").style.background = "#ef4444";
        setTimeout(function () {
